@startuml B2_ControlPanel
'==============================================================
' 实验四 B2  SafeHome 控制面板 ControlPanel 状态图
' 密码长度 4 位；连续错误 3 次锁定；锁定 120 秒后允许重新输入
' 状态别名与 Java 实现（com.hj212.experiment4.b2.PanelState）一一对应
'==============================================================

title B2  SafeHome 控制面板 ControlPanel 状态图

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam padding 6
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
  FontSize 13
}
hide empty description

state "空闲\n（等待户主操作）" as Idle
state "读取键入字符\n（长度 4 位）" as Reading
state "校验密码" as Verifying
state "锁定\n（禁止输入）" as Locked
state "系统功能选择" as Selecting

Idle : entry / 显示提示，关闭键盘指示灯
Reading : entry / 清空输入缓冲，字符数 = 0
Reading : do / 每收到一个按键即与密码长度比较
Verifying : entry / 输入串与系统密码比对
Locked : entry / 启动 120 秒定时器，屏蔽按键
Selecting : entry / 点亮功能指示灯

[*] --> Idle : 上电

Idle --> Reading : 按键 / 开始输入
Reading --> Reading : 按键 [字符数<4] / 追加
Reading --> Verifying : 按键 [字符数=4] / 提交

Verifying --> Selecting : [密码正确] / 清零错误计数
Verifying --> Reading : [密码错误，累计<3] / 计数+1
Verifying --> Locked : [密码错误，累计=3] / 计数+1

Locked --> Reading : after(120秒) / 清零计数

Selecting --> Idle : [功能结束或超时]

@enduml
